# Share your book as one web page

A READ.html file is your book and a reader in one web page. Anyone can open it in a browser, on any device, without a reading app.

1. Click the [Share]{.ui} tab.
2. Under [Read it in the browser]{.ui}, click [Package as READ.html]{.ui}. The file downloads.

Send the file to a reader, or put it on a website. To read it, open the file in a web browser.

The file is a copy: when you change the book, package it again and share the new file.
